stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NS_GREEN

    NS_GREEN --> NS_YELLOW : phase_timer >= adaptive_green OR emergency
    NS_YELLOW --> EW_GREEN : yellow >= 3s (normal)
    NS_YELLOW --> ALL_RED  : yellow >= 3s (preemption)

    EW_GREEN --> EW_YELLOW : phase_timer >= adaptive_green OR emergency
    EW_YELLOW --> NS_GREEN : yellow >= 3s (normal)
    EW_YELLOW --> ALL_RED  : yellow >= 3s (preemption)

    ALL_RED --> EMERGENCY : emergency_lane active
    ALL_RED --> RECOVERY  : emergency cleared
    EMERGENCY --> ALL_RED : ambulance clears
    RECOVERY --> NS_GREEN : recovery lane = NS
    RECOVERY --> EW_GREEN : recovery lane = EW
